Description
                    
                    

While spending their summer vacation, Scott and his sister Jerlin decided to create a fun number pattern using magic cards. Scott handed Jerlin green cards with positive numbers and red cards with negative numbers. However, there was a twist: they had to alternate between green and red cards, and any remaining cards were to be added at the end.

Create
a Java Program to help Jerlin in creating this new number pattern.

